<title>PORTUGAL: TAP, Hamburg Airlines sign code share pact.</title>
<headline>TAP, Hamburg Airlines sign code share pact.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portuguese state airline TAP-Air Portugal and Hamburg Airlines have signed a code sharing agreement for routes between Portugal and Hamburg effective on May 1, TAP said in a statement.</p>
<p>TAP operates four flights a week between Lisbon and Hamburg, while Hamburg Airlines operates two a week between Hamburg and Oporto.</p>
</text>
